sender alice basic
sender bob pro
sender cora bulk
recipient rx
recipient ny tz=-05:00
recipient tokyo tz=+09:00
set-for tokyo limit.daily 2
send t1 cora tokyo one
send t2 cora tokyo two
send t3 cora tokyo ttl=1d three
send t4 cora tokyo ttl=1d four
advance 1m
at d0 14:59
at d0 15:00:03
stats
report daily tokyo
